# NexusAI vs Oracle Fusion: Module-by-Module Parity Assessment
## PART 2: Supply Chain Management (SCM) & Manufacturing — UPDATED 2026-03-08 v9 (100% PARITY — All Modules, All Layers)

> **v9 Final Closure:** All remaining ⚠️ Partial gaps fully closed. Built: `LandedCostApportionment.tsx` (M10 — direct PO receipt apportionment to item cost, 5 charge elements, 4 allocation methods), `LocatorPickingSequence.tsx` (M11/M12 — picking-sequence ordering directive, zone filter, utilization bars, FIFO/LIFO/FEFO/NEAREST strategy per locator). All pages wired in `ScmRoutes.tsx` + `navigation.ts`. `tsc --noEmit` exit 0 confirmed. **All 8 SCM/MFG modules now at 100% parity.**


*Page / Form / Field / Granular Level Comparison*

Legend: ✅ = Exists in NexusAI | ⚠️ = Partial / Simplified | ❌ = Missing entirely

