|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `src/pages/inventory/ABCClassificationSetup.tsx` | `/api/inventory/abc-compiles` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** — grep returned zero results in server/ | L31–42 |
| 2 | `src/pages/inventory/CatchWeightEntry.tsx` | `/api/inventory/onhand/catch-weight` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L30–42 |
| 3 | `src/pages/procurement/SupplierQualificationManager.tsx` | `/api/procurement/supplier-assessments` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L22–34 |
| 4 | `src/pages/procurement/DropShipB2BWorkbench.tsx` | `/api/procurement/dropship` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L21–33 |
| 5 | `src/pages/manufacturing/ReworkOrderDispatcher.tsx` | `/api/manufacturing/rework-orders` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L29–52 |
| 6 | `src/pages/manufacturing/KanbanReplenishmentSetup.tsx` | `/api/manufacturing/kanban/cards` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L30–42 |
| 7 | `src/pages/manufacturing/FormulaYieldEditor.tsx` | `/api/manufacturing/formulas-list` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L26–39 |
| 8 | `src/pages/cost-management/OverheadAbsorptionRules.tsx` | `/api/cost-management/overhead-rules` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L21–33 |
| 9 | `src/pages/cost-management/PeriodCloseReconciliation.tsx` | `/api/cost-management/period-close` | ❌ **NO HANDLER** | L19–48 |
