### Secondary Finding: Inline `style={{}}` Violations (`.geminirules` HARD FAIL)

> Rule: *"React inline styles (`style={{ padding: '…' }}`) are FORBIDDEN."*

| File | Line | Violation |
|---|---|---|
| `src/pages/scm/wms/LocatorPickingSequence.tsx` | 107 | `style={{ width: \`${r.utilizationPct}%\` }}` — must use `<Progress value={r.utilizationPct} />` |
| `src/pages/scm/WmsDashboard.tsx` | 143 | `style={{ "--tw-progress-width": ..., backgroundColor: zone.color }}` — use `<Progress>` |
| `src/pages/manufacturing/MRPExplosionViewer.tsx` | 26 | `style={{ paddingLeft: \`${indent + 12}px\` }}` — indent via Tailwind `pl-*` classes |
| `src/pages/manufacturing/PhysicalInventory.tsx` | 136 | Dynamic `style={{ border: ... }}` — use `cn()` with conditional ring/border classes |
| `src/pages/manufacturing/PhysicalInventory.tsx` | 139 | `style={{ background: clr + '18', color: clr }}` — use semantic `<Badge>` |
| `src/pages/maintenance/AdvancedSchedulingBoard.tsx` | 217 | `style={{ width: '…' }}` progress bar — use `<Progress value={loadPercent} />` |
| `src/pages/maintenance/AdvancedSchedulingBoard.tsx` | 289 | `style={{ gridTemplateColumns: '200px repeat(…)' }}` — must use CSS variable trick |
| `src/pages/maintenance/AdvancedSchedulingBoard.tsx` | 329 | Same `gridTemplateColumns` violation |
| `src/pages/maintenance/AdvancedSchedulingBoard.tsx` | 356 | `style={{...}}` on schedule cell — use Tailwind arbitrary values or CSS vars |
| `src/pages/maintenance/AssetHealthDashboard.tsx` | 417 | `style={{ width: \`${asset.healthScore}%\` }}` — use `<Progress>` |
| `src/pages/maintenance/MaterialPlanningView.tsx` | 344 | `style={{ width: '…' }}` — use `<Progress>` |
| `src/pages/maintenance/AssetHierarchyTree.tsx` | 28 | `style={{ paddingLeft: \`${level * 16 + 8}px\` }}` — use `pl-*` Tailwind dynamic class |

