### Remediation Plan (Action Required)

All 13 HARD FAILs above require backend API route handlers to be built. The plan is organized from most critical (missing fundamental data endpoints) to secondary (style fixes).

#### Priority 1 — Build Missing Backend API Routes (13 Routes)

These must be added to a new `server/routes/scm-parity-phase56.ts` router file:

| # | API Route (GET+POST) | Parent Module | DB Table Needed |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `GET/POST /api/inventory/abc-compiles` | Inventory | `inv_abc_classes`, `inv_abc_assignments` |
| 2 | `GET/POST /api/inventory/onhand/catch-weight` | Inventory | `inv_onhand_balances` with `secondary_uom_qty` |
| 3 | `GET/POST /api/procurement/supplier-assessments` | Procurement | `po_supplier_scores` |
| 4 | `GET/POST /api/procurement/dropship` | Procurement | `po_drop_ship_links` |
| 5 | `GET/POST /api/manufacturing/rework-orders` | Manufacturing | `mfg_work_orders` (type=REWORK) |
| 6 | `GET/POST /api/manufacturing/kanban/cards` | Manufacturing | `inv_kanban_cards` |
| 7 | `GET /api/manufacturing/formulas-list` | Manufacturing | `mfg_formula_headers` |
| 8 | `GET/POST /api/cost-management/overhead-rules` | Cost Mgmt | `cst_overhead_rates` |
| 9 | `GET/POST /api/cost-management/period-close` | Cost Mgmt | Aggregate query: uncosted txns |
| 10 | `GET/POST /api/maintenance/cbm-rules` | Maintenance | `maint_cbm_rules` (remap from EAM) |
| 11 | `GET/POST /api/maintenance/meters/manage` | Maintenance | `maint_asset_meters` |
| 12 | `GET/POST /api/tms/freight-claims` | Transportation | `tms_freight_claims` |
| 13 | `GET/POST /api/finance/ap/ers-batches` | Finance/AP | `rcv_shipment_lines` where `ers_flag=true` |

#### Priority 2 — Fix Inline Style Violations (12 Instances)

Replace all `style={{…}}` with `<Progress>` component or Tailwind utility classes as detailed in the Secondary Finding table above.

#### Priority 3 — Upgrade Raw Form Patterns (4 Pages)

Wrap `PurchaseOrders.tsx`, `GoodsReceipt.tsx`, `GoodsReceiptPutaway.tsx`, `ProcurementSourcing.tsx` raw inputs with react-hook-form + Zod schema validation.

---

*Audit conducted: 2026-03-09 via live filesystem grep — 181 component files scanned across 8 modules.*
